WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.300
Episode 7

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.300
Sunken Yamato<i>!!
</i>Destined Fortress Seizure Battle<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.300
( Air date: Nov 17, 1974 )

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.350
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.150
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:40.300
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.080
Space Battleship

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.080
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.750
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:48.160
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:54.550
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.050 --> 00:01:03.350
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:10.150
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:16.850
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:42.560
Pluto

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:45.620
Pluto is the farthest
planet in the Solar System.

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.610
It has an elliptical orbit of 4.4 billion km
and 7.4 billion km in diameter...

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:55.300
...and it orbits the
Sun every 248 years.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:00.350
Its size is about 1/2 of Earth's,
so its gravity is weaker.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.780
It is a frozen world, with
temperatures of minus 200 degrees C.

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:18.120
Pluto Frontline Base

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.730
Yamato, identified.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.040
It's changing course
from PX703 to OP6.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.440
They don't even know
that we're on Pluto.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:42.580
Commander Shultz, let's attack.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:44.800
Wait, Gantz.
Don't take it lightly.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.210
You saw its capabilities
at Jupiter, didn't you ?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.500
It has that
Wave Motion gun.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.700
It shattered the floating
island with that gun.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.560
We can't defend against it.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.630
But, Commander Shultz...?

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:02.300
Don't worry, Gantz, but just think. We have
to use our brains to defeat the Yamato.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.100
Gamilusians are
very intelligent.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:10.800
Aren't you forgetting about
our latest weapon, Gantz ?

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.860
The Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.660
Reflective Satellite Cannon

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.920
It has more power, compared to the
Wave Motion gun, but a shorter range.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.840
That's as far as the Reflective Satellite
Cannon can reach, but the Yamato is there.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:33.730
{SOKODE}So we launch the Gamilus fleet, pretend
to intercept, and draw it within range.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:38.460
{HANSYA}A single shot from the Reflective Satellite
Cannon will bring us the Desler Medal.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:57.400
All nominal.
Engine pressure, normal.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.710
Kodai, your brother died in the
Battle of Pluto, didn't he ?

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.300
Yeah.  I wonder if they know
his brother has come this time.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.250
The Gamilus fleet has launched.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.730
But what if it's not
deceived and doesn't approach ?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:31.000
Don't worry. We'll launch our large
missiles like rain, and force it here.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.860
Look at our missiles.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.210
The Yamato will be destroyed.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:56.910
Gantz, what about
the attack on Earth ?

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.830
Sir, we launched
20 meteor bombs today.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.100
Radar contact.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:09.890
Vector OP3 102 to PZ1.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:10.970
They're meteor bombs.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.500
Captain, isn't there
an enemy base on Pluto ?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.220
There is.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.100
Let me destroy their base.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:29.000
I can't watch those meteor
bombs striking Earth any longer.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.800
Captain ?!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.500
I know.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:41.450
I intend to avoid combat as much as
possible on our journey to Iscandar...

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:43.560
...but the Pluto base
can't be overlooked.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:46.740
Shima, head for
Pluto at full speed.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.790
Kodai, advance in a
full combat formation.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:50.420
Aye, sir.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.730
The Yamato is approaching.
Distance, 200,000.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.340
Direction is
2Z 102 to OP 69.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.800
The Yamato is heading
here on its own.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.150
To the fleet.  Assume combat alert
and open a path for the Yamato.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.500
All hands, battle stations.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:10.900
Central Planning Room

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.560
This is the map of Pluto.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:15.210
The base on Pluto controls the meteor
bomb attacks which have ruined Earth.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:21.090
{imamade}Based on past attacks, we assume
that their base is near this bay.

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:24.220
We'll destroy this base.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.090
Kodai, good luck
avenging your brother.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:31.980
Shima, let's do our best.  We'll put an
end to their meteor bomb attacks today.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.000
Captain, are we going to
use the Wave Motion gun ?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.300
We can't use
the Wave Motion gun.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:43.120
There are indigenous
creatures on Pluto.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:48.130
If we use the Wave Motion gun,
we'll destroy them along with Pluto.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:53.500
We can't destroy the common property of
life in the Solar System, such as a planet.

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:56.880
But then...?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.590
We'll approach the
enemy base first.

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:04.290
Kodai, prepare for their surprise
attack. We're in their range.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.000
Aye, sir.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.980
Gamilus fleet, identified.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:19.050
45 degrees starboard high,
and 45 degrees port high.

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.750
Both groups are flying in the
same direction as the Yamato.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:39.120
Aim the shock cannons.
No. 1 to port, No. 2 to starboard.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:44.150
Aye, sir. Angle, 30 degrees port high,
30 degrees starboard high.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.140
The shock cannons
are ready to fire.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:57.050
Black Tigers, clear the area between
the Yamato and the enemy fleet.

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:04.980
Fire !

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.200
We did it !

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.200
Captain, we'll pursue.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:40.100
Gantz, don't let up,
or they'll figure out our plan.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.920
I'm going to the command room of
the Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.160
Large group of missiles ahead.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.590
Port full, bearing 2020.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:27.050
Prepare the anti-air missiles
and pulse lasers.  Open tubes.

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:29.170
Roger.
Opening tubes.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.660
Pulse lasers are
ready to fire.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:41.780
Firing anti-air missiles.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.280
Commence firing
the pulse lasers.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.880
Damage report.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:39.030
The first armor plating of
the aft engine room was torn.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.110
One hit on the Yamato.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.520
The Yamato is
showing its side to us.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.340
Good.  Prepare to fire the
Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.290
Reflective Satellite Cannon,
auto control circuit is nominal.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.410
Energy charge 150%.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:09.360
How pathetic. They don't know
that they're approaching hell.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.260
{GAMILUS}You'll face the terror of the
Gamilus Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:14.590
Prepare to fire.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:51.920
Fire.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.670
A high energy beam is
approaching the Yamato !

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.530
We've been hit !

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.500
Port side, damaged.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.540
The ship's braking system is
malfunctioning. I can't control the thrust.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:14.050
It's no good, we're gonna
crash at full speed.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:18.860
A moon of Pluto is at
15 degrees to starboard.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.770
Fire the rocket anchor.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.650
Aye, sir.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.990
Port thrusters, fire.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.090
Damn, I thought
we were finished.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.550
Damn Gamilus. What kind of weapon
was it ?  It scared the hell out of me.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.900
Captain, I'll take command
of the repair work.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:30.180
Kodai, if we stay here, we'll be
targeted by Gamilus, won't we ?

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:31.900
It'll be alright.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:36.810
We're on the far side from their base,
so we're in their blind spot.  Don't worry.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.450
The Yamato is on
the far side of Pluto.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.410
The far side ?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:48.880
You think you're hiding,
but you're not.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:51.760
The Reflective Satellite Cannon can
hit you, no matter where you are.

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:56.630
Open the panels on the Reflective
Satellites, and target the Yamato.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.050
Target is Yamato. Reflector
panel computer is set.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:13.830
Prepare Reflective Satellites,
number 2, 10, 11 and 6.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:32.090
Number 2, setup complete.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.700
Number 6, setup complete.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.350
Reflective Satellite
programming is complete.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.660
Prepare to fire.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.650
Fire.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.110
Energy beam
approaching the Yamato.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.670
I don't have time to slow down.
We're gonna crash.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:42.280
Captain, there's an
ocean near the equator.

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.350
Head for the equator.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.540
Land on the ocean, Shima.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.640
The Yamato is
heading for the ocean.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:56.670
One more blow, and I'll
terminate it once and for all.

00:18:57.390 --> 00:18:59.480
Prepare to fire the
Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.700
Closing the
watertight partitions.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.800
Landing complete.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.790
Chief Engineer Sanada, repair
the outer plating immediately.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:49.340
Aye, sir.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:50.360
Captain...

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.770
Captain, let me go
for reconnaissance.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:56.070
If the Yamato is struck by that
laser again, I doubt it could survive.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:58.990
Kodai, this is enemy territory.
Don't risk your life recklessly.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.250
It has the devil's luck.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:18.200
However, that place will
be your graveyard.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:22.200
Prepare to fire the
Reflective Satellite Cannon.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:25.540
Fire.

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.820
Energy beam from
directly above us !

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.230
The ship is listing !

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:04.700
Do something, quickly !

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:06.360
No, I can't !
Captain !

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:10.420
Pull yourself together, and stay
calm until you finish your job.

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:23.020
The Yamato is sinking.

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:29.070
That's the fate of those who
underestimate the power of Gamilus.

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:31.780
Gantz, inform Lord Desler.

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:39.050
Planet Gamilus

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:49.280
My Lord.

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:50.900
Pleasing news.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:56.920
The Pluto Frontline Base has engaged
the Yamato in combat and sunk it.

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:00.500
The Yamato has sunk.

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:06.450
And what of it ?

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:12.750
Oh, that's right.
It's only to be expected.

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:15.110
Idiot.

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.860
Yamato, what's wrong ?

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:23.190
Despite the hopes of mankind,
waiting for the radioactive purifier...

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:26.970
{MATAMO}...is it going to repeat history and become
scrap metal under the sea again ?

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:28.900
Yamato, rise up.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:34.440
Mankind will be extinct in 356 days.
You only have 356 days.

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:36.800
356 days left till the destruction of Earth

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:44.550
Okita Juzo:

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:44.550
Naya Goro

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:51.500
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:50.560
Mori Yuki:

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:50.560
Asagami Yoko

00:23:51.480 --> 00:24:00.980
Notes:
The Yamato flew from Jupiter to Saturn, changed its direction 140 degrees, and headed for Pluto, which was 5.4 million km away.

00:23:51.500 --> 00:24:00.300
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:08.600
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:10.980
Notes:
Shultz said, the Reflective Satellite Cannon is more powerful, but has a shorter range.

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:10.980
However, the Yamato only suffered medium
damage by a direct hit from the Reflective Satellite Cannon. Maybe he underestimated the power of the Wave Motion gun, as well as the armor of the Yamato.

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:17.500
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:16.980
Note:
Earth science could only destroy Gamilus ships with missiles in Ep.1.
But only fighter guns were needed to destroy
their ships in this episode.
Starsha's capsule may have contained the
weakness of the Gamilus alloy.

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:25.900
In the hearts of men, who are
leaving on a long journey...{Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa}

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:24.110
Translation

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:24.110
Editing

00:24:24.110 --> 00:24:31.680
Timing

00:24:24.110 --> 00:24:31.680
Song Translations

00:24:25.900 --> 00:24:33.500
...a piece of romance is needed.{Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa}

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:39.680
A

00:24:33.500 --> 00:24:37.500
La la la...

00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:41.500
La la la...

00:24:41.500 --> 00:24:51.400
La la la, red scarf.{makka na scarf}
